                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 2—Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Translation of Article 32 of the Nicaraguan
                        Constitution</hi>
                </head>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Article</hi> 32. No public power may remove cases
                    pending before competent authority, nor reopen cases which are terminated.</p>
                <p>In criminal matters recourse to revision of cases which have terminated, in which
                    the penalty imposed is more than correctional, may be had.</p>
            </div>
